# Taken by Nightmares: "Exile target creature. If you control an enchantment, scry 2." Bot1 controls a Flood (an enchantment) and
# exiles its own Ornithopter (any creature may be the target): it scries 2, the top two being Island and Forest, and puts the Forest on
# the bottom, so the Island is on top, then the Mountains.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Flood
Ornithopter
Taken by Nightmares
Swamp
Island
Forest
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flood.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Taken by Nightmares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Island | Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Bot1.Library.Top = Island
